<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="#">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Medical</span></div></div><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Markets we serve</div><h1 class="mk-h1">Medical electronics manufacturing</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures hearing aids, drug-delivery electronics, diagnostic devices and medical sensor assemblies on dedicated medical production lines operating under an ISO 13485 quality system. Manufacturing includes documented process control, traceability and formal change management, with medical capability available across multiple Hana sites.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#products" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Product examples</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div class="mk-ph" style="aspect-ratio:auto;height:420px;border-bottom:0;"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Medical &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div></div></div><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-bottom:52px;"><div class="mk-strip"><span class="hana-spec-label" style="flex-shrink:0;">Product examples</span><div class="mk-chips"><span>Hearing aids</span><span>Smart inhalers</span><span>Patient monitors</span><span>MEMS bio-sensors</span><span>Hearing-aid wireless charging cases</span><span>Diagnostic devices</span></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:760px;margin-bottom:34px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow on-dark">Why medical buyers choose Hana</div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Controlled manufacturing for regulated medical devices</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:14px 0 0;">Medical manufacturing requires documented process control, traceability and formal change management throughout production. Hana operates dedicated medical lines under an ISO 13485 quality system for hearing aids, sensors, drug-delivery electronics and diagnostic assemblies. Qualified medical manufacturing processes are available across multiple Hana sites, providing additional capacity and supply-continuity options within the group.</p></div><div class="mk-points"><div class="pt"><div class="t">ISO 13485 discipline</div><p>Dedicated medical lines operating under an ISO 13485 quality system, with documented process control, traceability and formal change management throughout production.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Miniature assembly</div><p>Micro-miniature assembly for hearing aids, MEMS sensors, drug-delivery electronics and diagnostic products.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Multi-site manufacturing</div><p>Medical manufacturing capability across Hana sites in Thailand and China provides additional capacity and supply-continuity options within the group.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="products" data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:28px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">Product examples</h2></div><div class="mk-cards c4"><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/medical/hearing-aid-assembly"><div class="mk-ph"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Hearing aid on a medical assembly line &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Hearing Aid Assembly</div><p>Micro-miniature assembly of hearing aids, including AI hearing aids and wireless charging cases, on dedicated medical manufacturing lines.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/medical/mems-sensors"><div class="mk-ph"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ MEMS sensor for a medical device &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Medical MEMS &amp; Sensors</div><p>Air-flow, pressure and gas-sensor assemblies for inhalers, respiratory, drug-delivery and diagnostic devices, with MEMS packaging and functional test capability.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/medical/pcba"><div class="mk-ph"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Medical PCBA under inspection &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Medical PCBA</div><p>PCB and flex assembly for patient-monitoring, diagnostic and miniature medical electronics, manufactured on dedicated medical lines with documented traceability.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/medical/wireless-charging"><div class="mk-ph"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Hearing-aid wireless charging case &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Wireless Charging (Medical)</div><p>Wireless charging cases and modules for hearing aids and wearable medical devices, including coil assembly, PCBA and finished-unit integration.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:720px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2><p class="mk-body">Medical programs run across Hana sites in Thailand and China, with dedicated medical manufacturing and MEMS/sensor assembly capability across the group. Programs can be qualified across more than one site where additional manufacturing capacity or supply continuity is required. See <a href="/locations">Locations</a> for plant-level detail.</p></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><div class="note">medical device assembly, dedicated medical SMT lines</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><div class="note">dedicated medical SMT lines, hearing-aid and device assembly</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ayutthaya"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div><div class="note">medical MEMS &amp; sensors</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div></div></section><section style="background:#fff;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mk-body">Common questions from medical device engineering and procurement teams.</p></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does Hana build for medical?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures hearing aids and their wireless charging cases, MEMS and sensor assemblies for inhalers and drug-delivery devices, and PCBAs for patient-monitoring and diagnostic equipment, using dedicated medical manufacturing processes under an ISO 13485 quality system.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Does Hana manufacture under ISO 13485?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana runs dedicated medical lines under an ISO 13485 quality system, with documented process control, traceability and formal change management throughout production.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Has Hana been inspected by a medical regulator?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana has been through US FDA inspection under 21 CFR 820, the FDA's quality system regulation for medical devices, alongside holding ISO 13485.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Which sites serve medical programs?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Medical work runs across Hana sites in Thailand, including Lamphun for device assembly and Ayutthaya for MEMS and sensors, and in China at Jiaxing. Programs can be qualified across multiple sites where additional capacity or supply continuity is required.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana handle micro-miniature medical assembly?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hearing aids and MEMS sensors are among the smallest assemblies Hana manufactures, with micro-miniature assembly supported by the group's wider microelectronics capability and applied under a medical quality system.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Start a medical build program with Hana</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what the device does and where it runs. We will point you to the right site and processes, and come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section>